// MDL: success
// PS-15: the minimal Slice 1 shape -- a hidden `minecraft:inventory_changed`
// advancement whose reward runs `player.say(...)` with `player` seeded as an
// ambient executor capture (Established{Player}), never a source-level
// query. The auto-revoke command is compiler-injected, not written here.
// HIR: on reward=@0 inventory_changed items=["minecraft:diamond"]
// HIR: entry-capture Executor<Player>
// CORE: advancement @adv0 reward=@fn0 inventory_changed items=["minecraft:diamond"]
// TARGET: advancement.revoke resource=
// PACK: "trigger":"minecraft:inventory_changed"
// PACK-NOT: "display"

on inventory_changed(.items = ["minecraft:diamond"]) |player| {
    player.say("MDL_GOT_DIAMOND");
}
